1
00:00:00,559 --> 00:00:02,153
AI helps you ship faster.

2
00:00:02,515 --> 00:00:04,504
But can you explain the code you just
pushed?

3
00:00:06,389 --> 00:00:06,964
Meet Ownit.

4
00:00:09,589 --> 00:00:11,944
A short debrief, right in your terminal.

5
00:00:14,389 --> 00:00:15,657
One to three questions.

6
00:00:16,019 --> 00:00:17,138
Why you made the change.

7
00:00:17,487 --> 00:00:18,293
How it works.

8
00:00:18,641 --> 00:00:19,625
What comes next.

9
00:00:22,789 --> 00:00:24,112
Answer in your own words.

10
00:00:24,473 --> 00:00:27,427
Build understanding while the change is
still fresh.

11
00:00:28,589 --> 00:00:29,205
Busy now?

12
00:00:29,553 --> 00:00:30,373
Come back later.

13
00:00:32,589 --> 00:00:32,988
Ownit.

14
00:00:33,336 --> 00:00:34,414
Own the code you ship.
